---
export const prerender = true;
import '../../../styles/global.css';
import '../../../styles/cai-doc.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
  <title>Cultivated AI · Questionnaire · The Baker's Dozen</title>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="cd-shell" style="--doc-accent: var(--color-amber);">

    <div class="cd-printhint screen-only">
      <span class="accent">Send or print →</span>
      Share this as a doc, or press <kbd>⌘ P</kbd> for a clean PDF. Ten questions, about five minutes.
    </div>

    <p class="cd-eyebrow">The Baker's Dozen · Workshop 1 · before we meet</p>
    <h1 class="cd-title">Ten quick <em>questions</em></h1>
    <p class="cd-lede">Five minutes, nothing formal. Your answers decide which examples we build the sessions around. Honest beats polished.</p>
    <div class="cd-rule"></div>

    <!-- ── You and AI so far ── -->
    <section class="cd-section is-amber">
      <div class="cd-section-rule"></div>
      <div class="cd-section-head">
        <span class="cd-section-num">Part 01</span>
        <h2 class="cd-section-name">You and <em>AI so far</em></h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="cd-qlist">
        <li class="cd-q"><span class="cd-q-num">Q01</span><div>
          <p class="cd-q-text">What's your role, and what does a normal week look like?</p>
          <p class="cd-q-why">So the examples come from your work, not a generic office.</p>
        </div></li>
        <li class="cd-q"><span class="cd-q-num">Q02</span><div>
          <p class="cd-q-text">Which AI tools have you tried, and which do you still use?</p>
          <p class="cd-q-why">Tells us where to start, and who can help a neighbour.</p>
        </div></li>
        <li class="cd-q"><span class="cd-q-num">Q03</span><div>
          <p class="cd-q-text">How often do you use them? Daily, weekly, rarely, never?</p>
          <p class="cd-q-why">No wrong answer. The room will have the full range.</p>
        </div></li>
        <li class="cd-q"><span class="cd-q-num">Q04</span><div>
          <p class="cd-q-text">What's one task you do every week that you'd happily never do again?</p>
          <p class="cd-q-why">These become the live demos.</p>
        </div></li>
        <li class="cd-q"><span class="cd-q-num">Q05</span><div>
          <p class="cd-q-text">What's something you tried with AI that didn't work?</p>
          <p class="cd-q-why">Failed attempts make the best teaching material.</p>
        </div></li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <!-- ── What you want from it ── -->
    <section class="cd-section is-teal">
      <div class="cd-section-rule"></div>
      <div class="cd-section-head">
        <span class="cd-section-num">Part 02</span>
        <h2 class="cd-section-name">What you <em>want from it</em></h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="cd-qlist">
        <li class="cd-q"><span class="cd-q-num">Q06</span><div>
          <p class="cd-q-text">What worries you about AI, honestly?</p>
          <p class="cd-q-why">We'd rather talk about it in the room than around it.</p>
        </div></li>
        <li class="cd-q"><span class="cd-q-num">Q07</span><div>
          <p class="cd-q-text">What would you love AI to do for you, if it just worked?</p>
          <p class="cd-q-why">Some of these are already possible. Those make great moments.</p>
        </div></li>
        <li class="cd-q"><span class="cd-q-num">Q08</span><div>
          <p class="cd-q-text">Do you have a Google account and a Claude or ChatGPT login on the laptop you're bringing?</p>
          <p class="cd-q-why">The coding block runs on Gemini, the rest on a chat assistant. We'll help set up anyone who's missing either.</p>
        </div></li>
        <li class="cd-q"><span class="cd-q-num">Q09</span><div>
          <p class="cd-q-text">Anything specific you want covered?</p>
          <p class="cd-q-why">If three people ask for the same thing, it gets its own slot.</p>
        </div></li>
        <li class="cd-q"><span class="cd-q-num">Q10</span><div>
          <p class="cd-q-text">One sentence: what would make these four hours worth it for you?</p>
          <p class="cd-q-why">This is the measure we'll check ourselves against.</p>
        </div></li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <div class="cd-footer">
      <span class="brand">Cultivated AI · <em>Grow, don't Chase.</em></span>
      <span>Workshop 1 · questionnaire</span>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
